caption: Have a Vision, and Work toward it

Have a Vision, and Work toward it: You must have a vision for the world, or at least your Pack. This must be an end state: a stable situation where everyone in involved is reasonably safe and happy. State this vision, at least to the GM, and gain a mark whenever you make progress toward that goal.
